            "review_title": "Review at Pig Chan Ramen & Sushi",
            "review_text": "yotsmn\nGeelong, Australia1165 contributions\n0\nA great find.\nMay 2023 • Couples\nMy wife and I passed this restaurant while walking to our hotel one afternoon, and decided to go for dinner the same day. What a find!! We loved everything about the place - extremely friendly staff, nice and clean and excellent food. We shared a beef udon, takoyaki and gyoza, all of which were delicious. All up cost with a beer and small water a super reasonable VND 340k. Would thoroughly recommend to others and will definitely be returning ourselves.\nRead more\nWritten May 26, 2023",
